 <!-- Embedded tilesets (no external .tsx reference - game-core's tiled::Loader
      only resolves this map's own virtual path, see tiles/tile_draw.rs).
      Both declared at a uniform 16x16 to match the map's own tile grid, even
      though tileset_bricks.png is really one 64x64 source image sliced into
      a 4x4 grid - avoids Tiled's oversized-tile placement/anchor rules,
      which game-core's tile_draw parsing doesn't implement. Image paths are
      resolved relative to extensions/game_core_demo/src/assets/ by the
      extension embedding them (bones_messages::game_core::TilesetImage,
      matched to these tilesets by `name`), never opened by game-core itself
      (tiled::Image only records the declared path/size from the XML). -->
